WEBVTT

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:02.214
That they would have
the courage to step out

00:05:02.214 --> 00:05:06.302
and to change the world
with an entrepreneurial lens.

00:05:07.511 --> 00:05:08.971
So that set us out,

00:05:08.971 --> 00:05:10.473
my husband and I,

00:05:10.514 --> 00:05:14.393
on a 15-year journey
to raise entrepreneurial kids.

00:05:15.144 --> 00:05:17.772
And we really saw this come together

00:05:17.813 --> 00:05:21.400
when my eldest son, Silas,
was nine years old.

00:05:23.361 --> 00:05:26.238
We had been living here in Maryland
for about two years,

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:29.241
and my husband was planning
to travel back to Colorado

00:05:29.283 --> 00:05:30.868
to visit his mother.